"""Pure helpers in bin/agentctl (loaded via the `agentctl` fixture).

These functions decide model resolution, worktree purpose/branch, profile
selection, and frontmatter parsing — the inputs to every dispatch. They touch
no filesystem, so they're cheap to pin. NB: default_profile resolves a repo
through projects.EXPLICIT_PROJECT_BY_NAME, which gained `agent-platform` in
Phase B (ARCH-099); MODEL_ALIASES is the Phase-C touchpoint (non-Anthropic
aliases). These tests pin today's mapping.
"""
