    """`real` includes an in-flight check-run (conclusion None), so it outranks a
    SKIPPED on the key (security-reviewer note on #190). That must leave the gate
    BLOCKED, not passed: an empty conclusion is not evidence of anything."""
    rollup = [_run_entry("python", "SKIPPED", "2026-07-20T10:00:00Z"),
              {"name": "python", "conclusion": None, "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
               "startedAt": "2026-07-20T11:00:00Z"}]
